abstract: >-
  Code and result artefacts for an audit of standard sparse-autoencoder quality metrics
  against measured single-feature ablation effects on ten open-weight language models,
  together with a zero-intervention first-order predictor and a three-level admission gate.
keywords:
  - sparse autoencoders
  - mechanistic interpretability
  - causal intervention
  - evaluation
